# What git holds here is the SOURCE OF TRUTH, not the output.
#
# The pipeline is built so that descriptors, prompts and specs are the authored
# artifacts and the media is a function of them: BUILD-SPEC §2b rule 5 makes every
# generation content-addressed, so an identical prompt+model+params reuses the cached
# object instead of regenerating. That means a render is reproducible from what is
# committed here, and a 174MB tree of PNGs is a cache, not a deliverable. Media belongs
# in object storage (B2), keyed by hash, with the descriptor in git pointing at it.
#
# The rule of thumb: if a tool wrote it, it is ignored. If a person or a model was
# *asked* to write it and the answer was kept, it is committed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# AGENT_GCP_KEY / GCP_PROJECT live here. Never commit; see .env.example.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- environments
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- caches
# .cache/ is the content-addressed store generate_stills.py writes through. Deleting it
# costs money to refill, which is exactly why it is a cache and not a source.
.cache/
content/.cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- generated media
# Renders, stills and takes. All reproducible from the YAML that is committed.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.MOV
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a

# Generated stills (768x1344 PNGs, ~1.3MB each). The prompt that made each one is in
# the edit, and its sidecar records model + hash, so the picture itself is derivable.
*.png

# Camera-original photography — large, and not what this repo is for.
*.heic
*.HEIC

# KEPT DELIBERATELY: *.jpg. These are the hook reference frames the style anchor is
# built from (characters/*-ref*.jpg). They are small, and they are the only record of
# what the image model was actually shown — losing them makes a rerun unreproducible.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- vendored binaries
# 38MB standalone; fetch it rather than carry it.
content/bin/yt-dlp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- os noise
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db

# Diagram build intermediates (infra/architecture.pdf is the committed deliverable).
infra/.build/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- app
app/.venv/
app/.remixkit-data/
app/**/__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform.tfvars

# Built on demand for sharing; the served page is index.html + wireframe.json
web/wireframe/standalone.html
